GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "5AE085F84E9A956C"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{EFA20963F57F71BA}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "I. Situation:"
     m_sContent "<h2>I. Situation:</h2>"\
     "<b>Time & Weather:</b>"\
     "Time - 17:15"\
     "Weather - Cloudy"\
     ""\
     "<b>Situation:</b>"\
     "A Soviet VDV Company has landed behind a US Brigade, cutting off logistics and reinforcements while it is being attacked by the 17th Guard Regiment. They've had 16hrs to dig in and prepare before a response was made with a US Company with an attached Bradley and Mortars are rushing in to sweep the occupied forest to re-secure the MSR, to allow reinforcements and supplies to reach the badly outnumbered US Brigade."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{16666214AA260A70}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "Americans are equipped with their standard NATO weaponry. etc"\
     "Wearing woodland coloured camo uniforms & helmets."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x US Rifle Company (-)"\
     "1x M2 Bradley"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location:</b>"\
     "West of Pasastjen Highway as marked on map at 033 057"\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Access to M16A1s series, M203, LAWs/M67s, M60, etc."\
     "1x Bradley"\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Establish a Company line to push through the treeline on both sides of the road with the Bradley down the road."\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Setup a Company line on both sides of the road, with the Bradley in the woods to support the infantry's push, negating our captured TOW."\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "3x Mortar Tubes for support."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "No known Air support."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "Very High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat as of now."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A8675858ECD4D273}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "Russians are equipped with their standard WARSAW Pact weaponry, AK series, RPG7s, RPKs."\
     "Wearing the standard USSR uniform of VDV Camo with greenish helmet."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x Company (-)"\
     "1x Mortar Tube"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location:</b>"\
     "Located south of Pasastjen occupying the road."\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Access to RPGs, RPKs, PKMs, NSVs, Mortars, etc."\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Lure us into Killzones, hurt us badly before pulling back."\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Lure us into Killzones, have mortar prep'd to land on our heads, severely weaken us before pulling back"\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "1x Mortar Tube."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "No known Air support."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "Very High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat as of now."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8525A02D89F88D19}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "Russian VDV Company is located south of Pasastjen at 047 059"\
     "Mortar located at 056 063"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Company has been tasked with maintaining control over the MSR to cut off supplies and reinforcements to the US Battalion currently being attacked by the 17th Guards Regiment."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x Company HQ"\
     "2x Platoon"\
     "1x Mortar Tube."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "Company HQ - At 3x Soldiers Strong"\
     "1st VDV Platoon - At 19x Soldiers Strong"\
     "2nd VDV Platoon - At 19x Soldiers Strong"\
     "Mortar Team - At 3x Soldiers Strong"\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "1x Mortar Tube."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "No air support available"\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "Box near the Flag Teleporter has spare Ammo."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{12AD083EE9CD571F}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "US Rifle Company (-) is located west of Pasastjen along the highway at 033 057"\
     "Mortar located at 028 061"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Sweep/Clear the forest along the MSR, Destroy the occupying VDV and clear the way to support a US Battalion trapped behind them."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x US Rifle Company (-)"\
     "1x Bradley"\
     "3x Mortar Tubes"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "Coy HQ - 2x Man Strength"\
     "1st Plt - At 37x Man Strength"\
     "2nd Plt - At 37x Man Strength"\
     "Bradley - At 3x Man Strength"\
     "Mortar Team - At 6x Man Strength"\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "3x Mortar Tubes."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "No air support available"\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "More ammo inside the Bradley."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{9F2C5D336CC5F530}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "<b>Delay the enemy and crush their advance.</b>"\
     ""\
     "Friendly Mortar Team is located at 056 063"\
     ""\
     "We do not need to die fighting for the 4x Forward Objectives (OBJ One & Two), as long as Objective Three the Farmstead is safe is what matters in the end. Use this to our advantage."\
     ""\
     "Recommend conducting a Delaying Defense, engage hard and pull back to further defenses."\
     ""\
     "Heavy Trenches have been dug forward near Objective One A & B, with Foxholes as Secondary Lines, MG positions setup along them as marked on map."\
     ""\
     "We have a captured TOW setup at the road."\
     "- TO USE THE TOW, hold down LEFT MOUSE BUTTON (LMB) for 4 Seconds and it will fire."\
     "- It is a little buggy but it will fire and destroy what's at the end of it. You have 2x extra reload tubes nearby"\
     ""\
     ""\
     "- You can teleport to markers on map from Spawn until safe time ends. (THE FLAG WILL DESPAWN AT END OF SAFESTART)"\
     "- Mortar Team can Teleport to Farmstead, however it is a ONE WAY teleport."\
     "- Biggest threat you have is the Enemy Bradley, utilize the captured TOW and plenty of RPGs to destroy the Bradley. (KEEP IN MIND OF WIND FOR RPGs)"\
     "- Shovel building has been mostly disabled, utilize the trenches already placed."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{178FF896C5525246}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Sweep BOTH sides of the forest (required) and secure the farmstead, destroying the VDV to make the road safe to push to support another US Battalion"\
     ""\
     "Friendly Mortar is located at 028 061"\
     ""\
     "The enemy has had 16hrs to prepare defenses AFTER landing at the MSR securing it. Expect Trenches and emplaced MG killzones. We a sent recon team earlier and they got into contact, marked on map of suspected enemy dug-in position"\
     ""\
     "Reports they ambushed a convoy 5hrs earlier, they may have captured US equipment like a TOW"\
     "The enemy has had 16hrs to prepare defenses AFTER landing at the MSR securing it. Expect Trenches and setup MG killzones. We sent a recon team earlier and they got into contact, marked on map of suspected enemy dug-in position"\
     ""\
     "Reports say they ambushed a convoy 5hrs earlier, they may have captured US equipment like a TOW"\
     ""\
     "Utilize the Mortars to flush out any hard dug-in forces or to setup smoke screen to allow easier maneuver."\
     ""\
     ""\
     "(YOU MUST secure both objectives at the front before proceeding to the next, read Mission Notes)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{072415BFED0C00D6}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Delay their attack and crush their advance."\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to utilize the trenches as much as possible, the emplaced MGs and the captured TOW. After engaging heavily it is recommended to fall back to make sure to prevent any unnecessary losses."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is highly advised to spread the platoon to each side of the road, with the platoons spreading the squads to prevent any flankers and to spot the enemy."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A537580015DE6900}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Clear the forest and re-establish control over the MSR."\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is to utilize the Bradley and Mortars to support the infantry's effort to sweep & clear the forests on both sides of the road."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to not split the company too much, likely a platoon on each side of the road with either the bradley on the road supporting and making sure the enemy cannot cross, or with the infantry in the woods although that would be dangerous."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5F650DF8A844C4AA}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Russian Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Russian Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Platoon Aid Post is to be setup by Platoon medics."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with company asset like the BTRs if there are any."\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by Platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "None."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{ED9988706F01912D}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard US Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard US Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "THE BRADLEY CONTAINS SPARE AMMUNITION."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Platoon Aid Post is to be setup by Platoon medics."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with company asset like the HMMWV or LAVIIs if there are any."\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by Platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "1x Bradley."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2BB2F55DF384305D}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "V. Command & Signals:"
     m_sContent "<h2>V. Command & Signal:</h2>"\
     "<b>I. Chain of Command:</b>"\
     "210, 211 (HQ), 215 (HQ), 211, etc"\
     ""\
     "<b>II. Callsigns:</b>"\
     "Company HQ -------------------------- 210"\
     ""\
     "Platoon HQ ---------------------------- 211 (HQ)"\
     "1st Squad ------------------------------ 211"\
     "2nd Squad ----------------------------- 212"\
     "3rd Squad ------------------------------ 213"\
     ""\
     "Platoon HQ ---------------------------- 214 (HQ)"\
     "1st Squad ------------------------------ 214"\
     "2nd Squad ----------------------------- 215"\
     "3rd Squad ------------------------------ 216"\
     ""\
     "<b>III. Frequencies:</b>"\
     "Company Net ------------------------- 42.00MHz"\
     "1st Platoon Net ------------------------- 43.00MHz"\
     "2nd Platoon Net ------------------------- 44.00MHz"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{29D0B766C559A565}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "V. Command & Signals:"
     m_sContent "<h2>V. Command & Signal:</h2>"\
     "<b>I. Chain of Command:</b>"\
     "C 6 - C 1'6 - C 2'6, C 1'1, etc etc."\
     ""\
     "<b>II. Callsigns:</b>"\
     "Company CO -------------------------- Chaos 6"\
     "Forward Observer ------------------- Chaos 8"\
     ""\
     "Platoon HQ ---------------------------- C 1"\
     "- Platoon Leader -------------------- C 1'6"\
     "- Platoon Sergeant ------------------ C 1'7"\
     "1st Section ---------------------------- C 1'1"\
     "2nd Section --------------------------- C 1'2"\
     "3rd Section ---------------------------- C 1'3"\
     ""\
     "Platoon HQ ---------------------------- C 2"\
     "- Platoon Leader -------------------- C 1'6"\
     "- Platoon Sergeant ------------------ C 2'7"\
     "1st Section ---------------------------- C 2'1"\
     "2nd Section --------------------------- C 2'2"\
     "3rd Section ---------------------------- C 2'3"\
     ""\
     "Bradley ---------------------------------- A 3'3V"\
     ""\
     "Mortar Battery ----------------------- Battery B - \"Backlash\""\
     ""\
     "<b>III. Frequencies:</b>"\
     "Company Net ----------------------- 48.00Mhz"\
     "1st Platoon Net -------------------- 49.00Mhz"\
     "2nd Platoon Net ------------------- 50.00Mhz"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{128E33B7D984F97E}" {
     m_iOrder 13
     m_sTitle "Mortars (MUST READ CREW)"
     m_sContent "<h2>Mortars</h2>"\
     ""\
     "<b>DO NOT FIRE THE MORTARS DURING SAFE START (ESPECIALLY AT EACH OTHER'S SPAWN).</b>"\
     ""\
     "<b>DO NOT SHOOT AT EACH OTHER'S SPAWN AFTER SAFE START</b>"\
     ""\
     "<b>DO NOT TRY AND MORTAR DUEL ONE ANOTHER</b>"\
     ""\
     "<b>BE MINDFUL OF WIND AS IT CAN MAKE YOU INACCURATE</b>"\
     ""\
     ""\
     "<b>HOWEVER, when safetime ends, you are FREE REIN anywhere besides SPAWNPOINTS and EACH OTHER'S MORTARS.</b>"
    }
    GC_Briefing "{AB51BD04265DEA8F}" {
     m_iOrder 14
     m_sTitle "VI. Mission Notes:"
     m_sContent "<h2>Mission Notes:</h2>"\
     "<b>Timelimit:</b>"\
     "- 60m (Can be increased by GM's Discretion) "\
     "- 5min Setup Timer."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Victory/Defeat Conditions:</h2>"\
     "<b>- Soviet Defeat </b>"\
     "- Suffering 95% Casualties OR Lose All 5 Objectives"\
     ""\
     "<b>- US Defeat</b>"\
     " - Suffering 85% Casualties OR Time Limit reached."\
     ""\
     "Order of capturable Objectives"\
     "- Objective One A & Objective One B "\
     "- Objective Two A & Objective Two B"\
     "- Objective Three"\
     ""\
     "Capture Zone is 100m Diameter (50m radius) from the center of the marker on map."\
     ""\
     "You cannot skip the order of securing Objectives, i.e. One A + B before Two A + B before Three"\
     ""\
     "<b>GM Discretion as usual.</b>"
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3CB13CE7FAE9DA4F}" {
     m_iOrder 15
     m_sTitle "Game Mastering (READ BEFORE LOBBY)"
     m_sContent "<h2>Game Mastering</h2>"\
     "This mission is not designed for game mastering besides for technical, administrative or diagnostic purposes."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
